      "Daniel 5:2–4, King James Version: “Belshazzar, whiles he tasted the wine, commanded to bring the golden and silver vessels which his father Ne…” — Sitting verify dock.",
      "Daniel 5:22–23, King James Version: “And thou his son, O Belshazzar, hast not humbled thine heart, though thou knewest all this; But hast lifted…” — Sitting verify dock.",
      "Daniel 5:25–28, King James Version: “And this is the writing that was written, MENE, MENE, TEKEL, UPHARSIN. This is the interpretation of the th…” — Sitting verify dock.",
      "Course audit: GLS-belshazzar-SMP/HIS/PRF in tools/review/gc-proof/ and tools/review/GLOSSARY_PROOF.md for sitting linkage."
